\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.55 kg (1.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 190 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  190  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ARM_Shoes_Barbarian_Magic</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ARM_Shoes_Barbarian_Magic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ARM_Shoes_Barbarian_Magic\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">edb7385a-e4d4-4fb7-ad9f-a9910e4b9e97</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:edb7385a-e4d4-4fb7-ad9f-a9910e4b9e97\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:edb7385a-e4d4-4fb7-ad9f-a9910e4b9e97\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Violence_ViolenceOnDash_Boots</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Violence_ViolenceOnDash_Boots+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Violence_ViolenceOnDash_Boots+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>File</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ARM_BarbarianMagical_A_Footwear</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Adrenaline_Rush\" title=\"Adrenaline Rush\">Adrenaline Rush</a></dt><dd>When you <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dash\" title=\"Dash\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/25px-Dash_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/38px-Dash_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/50px-Dash_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dash\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/25px-Dash_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dash\" title=\"Dash\">Dash</a> you gain <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wrath_(Condition)\" title=\"Wrath (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wrath\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wrath_(Condition)\" title=\"Wrath (Condition)\">Wrath</a> for 3 turns.<sup><i>[<a href=\"/wiki/Adrenaline_Rush#Bugs\" title=\"Adrenaline Rush\">See: Bugs</a>]</i></sup></dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Worg_Pens\" title=\"Worg Pens\">Worg Pens</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;379&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-39</span>: Worn by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Zurk\" title=\"Zurk\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Portrait_Zurk.png/25px-Portrait_Zurk.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/49/Portrait_Zurk.png/38px-Portrait_Zurk.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/49/Portrait_Zurk.png/50px-Portrait_Zurk.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Beastmaster Zurk\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Portrait_Zurk.png/25px-Portrait_Zurk.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/49/Portrait_Zurk.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Zurk\" title=\"Zurk\">Beastmaster Zurk</a></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\n<p><i>Regarding Adrenaline Rush:</i></p>\n<ul><li>The in-game tooltip stating that Adrenaline Rush grants 2 turns of Wrath is incorrect, it actually grants 3 turns of the condition.</li>\n<li>The in-game tooltip states that Adrenaline Rush is once per turn, but it is not.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 341.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 339.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Linebreaker_boots_dyed.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Dyed variations\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Linebreaker_boots_dyed.png/509px-Linebreaker_boots_dyed.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/Linebreaker_boots_dyed.png/764px-Linebreaker_boots_dyed.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/Linebreaker_boots_dyed.png/1018px-Linebreaker_boots_dyed.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dyed variations\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Linebreaker_boots_dyed.png/509px-Linebreaker_boots_dyed.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"340\" height=\"400\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bd/Linebreaker_boots_dyed.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dye\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dye\">Dyed</a> variations</div>\n\t\t<